<title>CHINA: Cheong Ming shares to resume trading.</title>
<headline>Cheong Ming shares to resume trading.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Cheong Ming Holdings Ltd, which was suspended on July 16, will resume on Monday, a company statement said.</p>
<p>The Hong Kong stock exchange and the Securities and Futures Commission had expressed concern over the increase in trading volume and its share prices, the statement said.</p>
<p>Trading in the shares could be suspended again in the event of any unusual trading activity, it said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6933</p>
</text>
